WEBVTT

00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:08.150
What have you done to him?

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:10.530
You're worried about him?

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:14.990
I simply let Noé suck my blood.

00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:20.540
After all, he didn't
know anything about us.

00:00:20.540 --> 00:00:27.500
I thought I'd let him have a peek
before he sucked your blood.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:29.500
My blood?

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:34.050
Now I see.

00:00:34.050 --> 00:00:35.180
Mikhail.

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:37.680
Call me <i>Misha</i>.

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:40.930
You don't remember anything.

00:00:42.430 --> 00:00:47.230
You don't remember what
happened to us that day?

00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:57.360
Or why I killed Luna,
the Vampire of the Blue Moon?

00:00:57.360 --> 00:00:59.620
Nothing at all?

00:02:22.120 --> 00:02:27.290
"The Case Study of Vanitas"

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:33.750
Oh.

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:36.090
Now I see.

00:02:36.090 --> 00:02:40.380
That's right. So isn't it only
natural that I would want to know?

00:02:40.380 --> 00:02:44.300
But that's not the only reason I'm here.

00:02:44.300 --> 00:02:48.430
I came to get you, Big Brother!

00:02:48.430 --> 00:02:51.100
You thought I was dead, didn't you?

00:02:51.100 --> 00:02:52.730
I did, too!

00:02:52.730 --> 00:02:57.610
My memory is foggy,
and I can't remember much.

00:02:57.610 --> 00:03:02.740
But I do recall feeling pain,
bitterness, and cold.

00:03:02.740 --> 00:03:08.580
But then someone kind saved me.

00:03:11.460 --> 00:03:16.960
And they told me there's a
way to bring Father back to life!

00:03:16.960 --> 00:03:21.680
Isn't that amazing? All three of us
will be able to live together again!

00:03:21.680 --> 00:03:27.850
Forget your stupid revenge,
and come with me, big brother!

00:03:30.770 --> 00:03:32.850
That's not like you.

00:03:32.850 --> 00:03:36.520
You usually don't use guns.

00:03:36.520 --> 00:03:38.940
Bring that vampire back?

00:03:38.940 --> 00:03:40.490
Are you insane?!

00:03:40.490 --> 00:03:43.490
Do you know how hard
I tried to wipe out all traces

00:03:43.490 --> 00:03:46.830
of that vampire's existence?!

00:03:46.830 --> 00:03:48.950
P-Please, stop this!

00:03:48.950 --> 00:03:52.330
If something happens
to Mikhail, Domi will...!

00:03:52.330 --> 00:03:56.290
Domi will jump from up there!

00:04:00.630 --> 00:04:06.300
Get out of the way.
I will finish him off myself.

00:04:06.300 --> 00:04:09.470
No, I can't do that!

00:04:09.470 --> 00:04:13.890
Vanitas. He's holding Domi hostage!

00:04:13.890 --> 00:04:16.690
He must have done
something with that book of his.

00:04:16.690 --> 00:04:18.440
So what if he has?

00:04:18.440 --> 00:04:21.820
It has nothing to do with me.

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:24.360
But...

00:04:24.360 --> 00:04:26.870
That may be true.

00:04:29.870 --> 00:04:31.910
But I'm begging you, Vanitas!

00:04:31.910 --> 00:04:35.120
Please tell me what happened that day!

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:38.170
I know you have your reasons!

00:04:38.170 --> 00:04:42.210
But I don't want to do
what Mikhail wants me to.

00:04:42.210 --> 00:04:45.340
If you would only tell me yourself--

00:04:48.550 --> 00:04:50.390
Spare me.

00:04:51.970 --> 00:04:56.020
You've got the wrong impression.

00:04:56.020 --> 00:05:00.900
We're only working together
because our interests happened to align.

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:01.900
Vanitas.

00:05:01.900 --> 00:05:04.070
You're nobody to me.

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:05.990
I'll leave when you're no longer useful.

00:05:05.990 --> 00:05:06.570
--Vanitas.

00:05:06.570 --> 00:05:07.990
--I'll kill you if you get in my way.
--Vanitas.

00:05:07.990 --> 00:05:08.570
--I'll kill you if you get in my way.
--Vani--

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:09.780
--That's all you are to me.
--Vani--

00:05:09.780 --> 00:05:12.540
Vanitas!

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:18.580
None of that matters right now!
Domi is the one person I can't lose!

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:23.670
I can't because I failed to protect Louis!

00:05:23.670 --> 00:05:25.090
Louis?

00:05:25.090 --> 00:05:28.220
Louis is Mademoiselle Domi's big brother.

00:05:28.220 --> 00:05:34.270
He was beheaded for being a curse-bearer,
right in front of Noé and Domi.

00:05:34.270 --> 00:05:36.980
She couldn't stop crying.

00:05:36.980 --> 00:05:41.900
And she said, "I wish
I'd been the curse-bearer,"

00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:47.660
and "Noé would've been happier
if Louis had lived instead of me."

00:05:47.660 --> 00:05:51.580
Domi. You're going to
keep your hair short now?

00:05:52.870 --> 00:05:58.750
It's not that I don't like it.
I mean, it suits you well, but...

00:05:58.750 --> 00:06:03.750
I like you with long hair, too!

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:07.510
That's the Domi I know and love.

00:06:07.510 --> 00:06:09.470
I really like it!

00:06:12.010 --> 00:06:14.680
Really?

00:06:14.680 --> 00:06:19.020
You wouldn't mind if
I grew my hair long again?

00:06:21.860 --> 00:06:23.360
Enough!

00:06:23.360 --> 00:06:26.030
Go lick each other's wounds elsewhere!

00:06:26.030 --> 00:06:29.280
Just leave me out of it!

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:31.240
And I already told you!

00:06:31.240 --> 00:06:34.950
I <i>will</i> kill you if you
try to suck my blood!

00:06:34.950 --> 00:06:38.460
Now get out of my sight!

00:06:38.460 --> 00:06:43.790
But if you won't budge,
I'll start by finishing her off!

00:06:43.790 --> 00:06:46.800
That would set you free, at least.

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:52.090
That bossy dame
wouldn't bedevil you anymore!

00:07:01.190 --> 00:07:03.190
I beg you.

00:07:03.190 --> 00:07:08.150
Don't ever let anyone seize your memories.

00:08:02.870 --> 00:08:07.630
Yes! That's it! Don't give up, you two!

00:08:07.630 --> 00:08:11.090
Fight like you're banishing
a nightmare in dreamland!

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:14.220
Lose yourself in your murderous rage!

00:08:24.520 --> 00:08:29.400
Kill him. Kill...

00:08:29.400 --> 00:08:35.070
Kill him. Kill...

00:08:35.070 --> 00:08:40.910
I <i>will</i> kill anyone who tries to seize
my memories, no matter who they are.

00:08:40.910 --> 00:08:44.250
Kill him. Kill.

00:08:44.250 --> 00:08:48.090
I will...

00:08:49.170 --> 00:08:52.010
...kill Noé.

00:08:52.010 --> 00:08:57.180
I will kill... that vampire!

00:10:25.640 --> 00:10:28.270
What's the point of this?

00:10:31.190 --> 00:10:32.150
Dante?!

00:10:32.150 --> 00:10:34.690
Oh, dear! What happened to you?!

00:10:34.690 --> 00:10:37.190
Did you get into another drunken brawl?

00:10:37.190 --> 00:10:41.070
No! That quack did a number on me!

00:10:41.070 --> 00:10:43.160
Dear Vanitas did this?

00:10:43.160 --> 00:10:46.910
The fool stole my god damn gun.

00:10:46.910 --> 00:10:52.580
You see, it seems something terrible
may have befallen Lady Dominique.

00:10:52.580 --> 00:10:56.760
Noé went racing off with murder
in his eyes when he heard that.

00:10:56.760 --> 00:11:01.180
That's when I knew I had
to tell Monsieur Vanitas.

00:11:01.180 --> 00:11:06.020
I just hope that damn quack
doesn't end up attacking his chum.

00:11:06.020 --> 00:11:11.270
Why would he do that?!
Didn't Vanitas go to save Noé?!

00:11:11.270 --> 00:11:15.690
Most likely not.
He had this look in his eyes.

00:11:15.690 --> 00:11:21.280
But even if Noé can only use one arm,
he's still far more powerful than Vanitas.

00:11:21.280 --> 00:11:23.120
So it won't get that bad, will it?

00:11:23.120 --> 00:11:24.580
I wouldn't be so sure.

00:11:24.580 --> 00:11:29.870
Noé's never killed anyone, has he?

00:11:31.960 --> 00:11:37.170
He knows how strong he is,
so he thinks he can keep his hands clean.

00:11:38.760 --> 00:11:44.760
He abhors violence, but he knows
he can use it to silence others.

00:11:46.260 --> 00:11:48.270
It's so annoying.

00:11:53.940 --> 00:12:01.030
The bullet only grazed my eyelid.
It shouldn't be an issue, so then why...

00:12:01.030 --> 00:12:05.700
I'm stronger and faster than Vanitas,
yet I still can't catch him.

00:12:05.700 --> 00:12:09.790
It's as if he's anticipating
my every move.

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:14.540
If I don't hurry, Domi will...!

00:12:17.630 --> 00:12:19.590
He's coming right at me!

00:12:19.590 --> 00:12:20.840
This is bad.

00:12:20.840 --> 00:12:22.590
--He's a goner if I score a direct hit.

00:12:22.590 --> 00:12:22.930
--Stop!
--He's a goner if I score a direct hit.

00:12:22.930 --> 00:12:23.470
--Stop!
--I can't stop, but I
don't want to kill him.

00:12:23.470 --> 00:12:24.550
--Stop!
--I can't stop, but I
don't want to kill him.

00:12:24.550 --> 00:12:26.600
Stop!

00:12:26.600 --> 00:12:28.260
Stop this.

00:12:28.260 --> 00:12:32.810
Some don't want to kill
because they are strong.

00:12:32.810 --> 00:12:37.610
Others will do anything to
survive because they are weak.

00:12:37.610 --> 00:12:41.690
But when the chips are down, one sees
the crucial difference between them.

00:13:13.850 --> 00:13:20.070
I would have already killed
him if I hadn't held back.

00:13:22.940 --> 00:13:26.030
No, that's not it.

00:13:26.030 --> 00:13:32.330
He's coming at me because
he's sure I don't want to kill him.

00:13:32.330 --> 00:13:39.460
He's most likely aware of attack
patterns that I don't even realize I have.

00:13:39.460 --> 00:13:41.420
That's why...

00:13:45.010 --> 00:13:47.430
Damn you.

00:13:47.430 --> 00:13:51.220
He said I don't know a thing about you!

00:13:51.220 --> 00:13:53.890
Then he laughed at me!

00:13:55.810 --> 00:13:58.020
It's always the same with you!

00:13:58.020 --> 00:14:01.610
You always have this look
as if you alone know everything!

00:14:02.780 --> 00:14:06.990
And yet you never tell me anything!

00:14:08.530 --> 00:14:10.410
It makes me sick!

00:14:10.410 --> 00:14:13.830
The way you've treated
those dear to me with contempt!

00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:17.370
The way you've never
listened to a word I've said!

00:14:17.370 --> 00:14:23.670
And the way you've dismissed
everything so far as if it never happened!

00:14:23.670 --> 00:14:27.050
Don't you have anything
to say for yourself, Vanitas?!

00:14:27.050 --> 00:14:30.050
At least say <i>something</i>?!

00:14:36.890 --> 00:14:38.890
You're wasting your breath.

00:14:38.890 --> 00:14:44.150
My brother used a form
of self-hypnosis on himself.

00:14:45.570 --> 00:14:48.780
So now, if anyone tries
to seize his memories,

00:14:48.780 --> 00:14:52.030
he'll try to kill them without fail.

00:14:54.200 --> 00:14:57.960
No matter who they are, he <i>will</i> kill them.

00:15:04.170 --> 00:15:08.840
Don't worry, big brother.
Even if you slay Noé,

00:15:08.840 --> 00:15:12.850
even if it leaves you damaged and
torn up inside because you miss him,

00:15:12.850 --> 00:15:16.810
I'll be by your side forever and ever.

00:15:16.810 --> 00:15:20.190
I'm the only one who'll always be there.

00:15:29.490 --> 00:15:31.820
Noé.

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:36.660
Noé's hurt. I must help him.

00:15:36.660 --> 00:15:37.910
No.

00:15:37.910 --> 00:15:41.790
Misha's watch alarm
will go off any moment now.

00:15:41.790 --> 00:15:47.670
I'll have to jump from the
Ferris wheel when I hear it.

00:15:47.670 --> 00:15:51.430
Yes. That's what I must do.

00:15:53.140 --> 00:15:55.930
B-But...

00:15:55.930 --> 00:16:02.520
But I can't bear to stand here,
watching Noé get hurt.

00:16:02.520 --> 00:16:08.280
I couldn't go on living
if I were to lose him.

00:16:08.280 --> 00:16:11.700
Then how about this?

00:16:11.700 --> 00:16:17.280
You can do what Misha
told you <i>and</i> stop Noé's battle.

00:16:17.280 --> 00:16:20.910
There's a way to do both, isn't there?

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:24.580
All right.

00:16:24.580 --> 00:16:26.750
I'll do it.

00:16:33.180 --> 00:16:38.470
If Noé won't get hurt
anymore because of me...

00:16:39.770 --> 00:16:44.440
If I can keep him from
crying like he did that time...

00:16:45.560 --> 00:16:47.610
That's silly.

00:16:49.940 --> 00:16:53.650
Are you truly doing that for Noé?

00:16:53.650 --> 00:16:57.490
Domi!

00:17:05.500 --> 00:17:06.920
Who's that?

00:17:06.920 --> 00:17:10.000
Lady Dominique! Are you all right?!

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:12.260
My lady! Are you hurt?

00:17:12.260 --> 00:17:13.340
Jeanne!

00:17:13.340 --> 00:17:19.100
Noé, what is going on here?!
Why are you and Vanitas fighting?

00:17:19.100 --> 00:17:20.470
Lady Dominique?!

00:17:20.470 --> 00:17:25.140
Jeanne. I don't want you here.

00:17:25.140 --> 00:17:30.270
Stay back. No, go away.

00:17:30.270 --> 00:17:33.690
I hate you, Jeanne!

00:17:35.570 --> 00:17:37.780
N-No.

00:17:37.780 --> 00:17:40.370
I mustn't...

00:17:40.370 --> 00:17:41.830
Mademoiselle.

00:17:41.830 --> 00:17:45.830
Everyone who stands
in our way is a villain.

00:17:45.830 --> 00:17:47.790
Will you slay them with me?

00:17:47.790 --> 00:17:51.210
So you're the one behind all this?!

00:17:51.210 --> 00:17:53.380
Jeanne, don't! He is--

00:17:53.380 --> 00:17:54.420
Noé!

00:17:54.420 --> 00:17:57.380
I'm here on Master Luca's orders!

00:17:57.380 --> 00:18:01.260
I'm going to save Lady
Dominique! That is my vow!

00:18:01.260 --> 00:18:03.470
Vanitas is yours.

00:18:03.470 --> 00:18:06.230
Keep an eye on him!

00:18:06.230 --> 00:18:10.650
Keep an eye... on Vanitas?

00:18:10.650 --> 00:18:13.780
I don't need to be told that.

00:18:24.240 --> 00:18:29.710
Now you won't be able to use
that scary weapon for a while.

00:18:29.710 --> 00:18:32.460
He interfered with the astermite?!

00:18:47.180 --> 00:18:52.900
Have I... always looked like this?

00:18:52.900 --> 00:18:55.690
And Vanitas?

00:18:55.690 --> 00:18:58.530
I can't remember what he looks like.

00:18:58.530 --> 00:19:01.280
Go lick each other's wounds elsewhere!

00:19:01.280 --> 00:19:03.830
Just leave me out of it.

00:19:03.830 --> 00:19:06.330
What did I see?

00:19:06.330 --> 00:19:09.540
Now get out of my sight!

00:19:09.540 --> 00:19:15.170
But if you won't budge,
I'll start by finishing her off!

00:19:31.230 --> 00:19:36.650
It's just as Mikhail said.
I know nothing about Vanitas's past.

00:19:40.900 --> 00:19:42.780
Even so...

00:19:44.700 --> 00:19:50.290
I've been watching him...
ever since we met.

00:19:51.580 --> 00:19:54.790
I've seen what kind of person he is.

00:20:04.720 --> 00:20:08.720
Let's end this now, Vanitas.

00:20:10.390 --> 00:20:15.110
I want to go back to the way it was.

00:20:31.000 --> 00:20:35.920
He's adversarial and always
does exactly what he wants.

00:20:35.920 --> 00:20:37.170
Vanitas!

00:20:37.170 --> 00:20:40.710
He doesn't care if he gets hurt

00:20:40.710 --> 00:20:43.680
but can't let others
get hurt because of him.

00:20:43.680 --> 00:20:45.180
Vanitas!

00:20:45.180 --> 00:20:49.680
He pushes everyone away
in an effort to isolate himself.

00:20:49.680 --> 00:20:52.730
That would set you free, at least.

00:20:52.730 --> 00:20:54.480
Now I see.

00:20:54.480 --> 00:21:00.030
What he calls being "free"
actually means being "alone."

00:21:00.030 --> 00:21:03.150
Kill. Kill him.

00:21:03.150 --> 00:21:06.700
Kill that vampire!

00:21:07.830 --> 00:21:13.080
My name is Noé, not "that vampire"!

00:21:26.050 --> 00:21:29.390
This is absurd. It really is.

00:21:30.430 --> 00:21:32.770
Listen to me, Vanitas!

00:21:32.770 --> 00:21:36.650
I will never do the one thing you wish.

00:21:36.650 --> 00:21:40.940
I am never going to set you free!

00:22:00.590 --> 00:22:04.880
"Tears like Rain"

00:23:36.680 --> 00:23:41.160
"His Wish"
